1
00:00:02,974 --> 00:00:05,044
(Amy:)If we're going to be staying
in this apartment,

2
00:00:05,043 --> 00:00:06,473
(Amy:)would you be interested
in doing a little

3
00:00:06,478 --> 00:00:07,878
(Amy:)redecorating?

4
00:00:08,713 --> 00:00:11,853
(Sheldon:)Oh, actually, I would.

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,720
(Amy:)Great, what'd you have in mind?

6
00:00:13,718 --> 00:00:16,858
(Sheldon:)Let's take every single thing
from the other apartment

7
00:00:16,855 --> 00:00:18,955
(Sheldon:)and put it in here.

8
00:00:18,957 --> 00:00:21,457
(Amy:)Well, how about we start
a little smaller?

9
00:00:21,459 --> 00:00:23,889
(Amy:)Like moving
the furniture around.

10
00:00:23,895 --> 00:00:26,125
(Sheldon:)You know, I have always thought

11
00:00:26,131 --> 00:00:28,061
(Sheldon:)that this couch
would look fantastic

12
00:00:28,066 --> 00:00:30,696
(Sheldon:)on the curb
in front of the building.

13
00:00:30,702 --> 00:00:34,202
(Amy:)Look, we can't just
throw away Penny's stuff,

14
00:00:34,205 --> 00:00:37,775
(Amy:)but we can ask
if she wants any of it back.

15
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:40,640
(Sheldon:)You know, I wonder how
she feels about

16
00:00:40,645 --> 00:00:42,915
(Sheldon:)all this artwork.

17
00:00:42,914 --> 00:00:45,544
(Amy:)Well, I'm sure
she misses this one.

18
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:48,920
(Amy:)I mean, it's the greatest gift
I've ever given anybody.

19
00:00:54,526 --> 00:00:59,326
(Sheldon:)It truly does capture the beauty
of your friendship with Penny.

20
00:01:01,266 --> 00:01:02,996
(Amy:)It may have appreciated
in value.

21
00:01:03,001 --> 00:01:06,171
(Amy:)The artist killed himself
shortly after painting that.

22
00:01:07,205 --> 00:01:10,875
(Sheldon:)Yeah, it seems only right
that she have it back.

23
00:01:10,875 --> 00:01:12,475
(Amy:)I can't wait to see
the look on her face

24
00:01:12,477 --> 00:01:15,077
(Amy:)when I give it to her again.

25
00:01:20,351 --> 00:01:23,921
(Sheldon:)Look, it's the same smile
she has in the painting.

26
00:01:24,989 --> 00:01:28,389
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

